*_raw_eeg_prediction' to '*_raw_eeg_1d_prediction' and assigned df[...] = test_raw_eeg_1d_predictions (variable/column name alignment). | score after: n/a\nv45 -> v46: Fix the post-processing/submission step to use the 1D EEG prediction columns so normalized probabilities and the submission contain the intended predictions. | change: Replaced raw_eeg_prediction_columns with raw_eeg_1d_prediction_columns in normalize_probabilities call and in assignment to df_submission (two-line change). | score after: 0.46059\nv46 -> v47: Increase model capacity and adjust inference-time augmentation while loading a new set of pretrained checkpoints to try and improve inference performance. | change: Modified the EEGNet class (planes increased 24→128, ReLU→LeakyReLU, head input_dimensions 168→256, resnet blocks 9→11). Switched model_directory to a v1.3 checkpoint folder and replaced the list of model filenames (checkpoint swap). Tweaked temporal  | score after: 0.41674 (+0.04385)\nv47 -> v48: Refine the ResNet1DBlock implementation (conv/bias/dropout/order) and load updated v1.4 fold checkpoints to improve inference accuracy. | change: Changed ResNet1DBlock internals: added a second conv (conv2), changed conv1/conv2 bias settings, removed Dropout usage, reordered forward pass (conv1->bn1->relu->conv2->bn2->pool->add->relu), commented-out weight init, and slightly refactored block a | score after: 0.42174 (-0.00500)\nv48 -> v49: Fix a bug in the model forward pass (apply ReLU to the summed outputs) and switch to a different set of pretrained checkpoint files used for inference averaging. | change: Fixed forward() to apply ReLU to the combined 'outputs' tensor instead of 'x', removed commented-out initialization code, and replaced the five model checkpoint filenames passed to the inference loader. | score after: 0.41042 (+0.01132)\nv49 -> v50: Switch to a newer set of fold checkpoints and change interpolation/fill strategy for EEG signals to improve inference robustness and accuracy. | change: Changed model_directory from v1.4 to v1.5 and replaced the five fold checkpoint filenames with updated checkpoints; modified EEG missing-value handling from .interpolate(...).ffill().bfill() to .interpolate(limit_area='inside') followed by .fillna(0) | score after: 0.41016 (+0.00026)\nv50 -> v51: Use updated v1.6 EEGNet checkpoints (new model files) for inference so the ensemble predictions improve. | change: Changed model_directory from 'raw_eeg_1d_eegnet_10000x19_v1.5' to 'raw_eeg_1d_eegnet_10000x19_v1.6' and swapped the five fold checkpoint filenames to updated versions (different kl_divergence suffixes). | score after: 0.41096 (-0.00080)\nv51 -> v52: Use newer/better EEGNet checkpoints, add horizontal flip augmentation and broaden TTA (add combined flips), plus small EEGNet code cleanup to improve inference performance. | change: Renamed self.relu to self.activation (cosmetic), reordered EEGNet __init__ arguments and simplified kernel iteration, swapped model_directory from v1.6→v1.7 and updated checkpoint filenames, added A.HorizontalFlip to transforms, and expanded TTA to i | score after: 0.42095 (-0.00999)\nv52 -> v53: Swap in updated ensemble checkpoints and refine preprocessing/transforms (add EKG-aware channel-difference handling and fix filtering), plus small model refactors to ensure correct forward behavior for inference. | change: Refactored module internals (renamed pooling/blocks variables and adjusted forward outputs), swapped model_directory and checkpoint filenames to a different EEGNet checkpoint set, added ekg flag to ChannelDifference and made it produce 18/19-channel  | score after: 0.42162 (-0.00068)\nv53 -> v54: Switch to a different set of EEGNet checkpoints, parameterize temporal dropout and instance-normalization behavior, and remove the (unused) spectrogram inference so the ensemble uses only raw EEG models. | change: Updated model_directory and model_file_names to a new checkpoint set; refactored InstanceNormalization1D (replaced log_scale/channel_wise with per_channel) and switched dropout transforms from hard-coded literals to values read from transform_paramet | score after: 0.41624 (+0.00538)\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
